C(11080,'stated without proof','B','RS-DELZANT','R-Delzant1962 R-EKM','The rank-zero idealJ maps isomorphically to the even-rank Witt idealI, compatibly with products and powers. Subtracting the appropriate multiple of the hyperbolic plane proves surjectivity; rank proves injectivity.','Delzant1962; independent proof2026-11-19',proof='research/root_proofs.md R8',origin='Delzant context; identification made explicit by the notes')
